      badge: '<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider border border-purple-500/30"><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z"/></svg>Program · Japan</span>',
      content: `<p><strong>📅 March 2 - 27, 2026 | 📍 Shimoda, Japan</strong></p>
                <p>A one-month program where you'll try out 10 different remote-friendly jobs through hands-on workshops led by experienced mentors.</p>
                <p>Immerse yourself in local life, sharing meals with new friends, joining community events, and enjoying the slow pace of living by the ocean.</p>
